# Project Scope

The project consists of four independent portals that share a common backend.

```
Public Website

↓

Customer Portal

↓

Admin Portal

↓

Farm Staff Portal
```

---

# Portal Overview

## 1. Public Website

Purpose

Public awareness and customer acquisition.

Modules

* Home
* About
* Products


* Events
* Gallery
* Blogs
* Contact

---

## 2. Customer Portal

Purpose

Customer self-service.

Modules

* Dashboard
* Orders

* Wishlist
* Profile

---

## 3. Admin Portal

Purpose

Business management.

Modules

* Dashboard
* Products
* Categories
* Orders
* Customers
* Inventory
* Staff
* Analytics
* Settings

---

## 4. Farm Staff Portal

Purpose

Daily farm operations.

Modules

* Cow Records
* Milk Production
* Health
* Vaccination
* Feed
* Medicine
* Expenses
* Reports

